###Block: Epic Item Creation Feats

Cannibal Crafting	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.ItemCreation	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:You can salvage the magical essence of existing magic items and use it as raw materials for crafting new items.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.69
Craft Epic Magic Arms and Armor	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.ItemCreation	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=28	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Craft Magic Arms and Armor	DESC:You can create magic arms and armor of epic power, with enhancement bonuses greater than +5 or with epic special abilities.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.69
Craft Epic Rod	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.ItemCreation	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=28	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Craft Rod	DESC:You can create epic rods with powers beyond normal limits.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.69
Craft Epic Staff	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.ItemCreation	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=28	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Craft Staff	DESC:You can create epic staves with powers beyond normal limits.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.69
Craft Epic Wondrous Item	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.ItemCreation	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=28	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Craft Wondrous Item	DESC:You can create epic wondrous items with powers beyond normal limits.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.69
Efficient Item Creation	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.ItemCreation	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	DESC:You craft magic items in half the normal time.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.69
Epic Cooperation	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.ItemCreation	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:When assisting another crafter, you provide a +4 bonus instead of +2 and can contribute spell prerequisites.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.69
Forge Epic Ring	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.ItemCreation	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=28	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Forge Ring	DESC:You can create epic rings with powers beyond normal limits.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.70
Master Brewer	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.ItemCreation	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Brew Potion	DESC:You can brew potions of spells up to 6th level and increase the caster level cap of your potions.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.70
Prudent Crafter	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.ItemCreation	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=25	DESC:When crafting magic items, you can reduce the gold cost by 10%% by increasing the DC by 5.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.70
Scribe Epic Scroll	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.ItemCreation	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=28	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Scribe Scroll	DESC:You can scribe epic scrolls with powers beyond normal limits.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.70
Skillful Augmentation	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.ItemCreation	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=27	DESC:You can add new abilities to existing magic items without the usual 50%% cost increase.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.70
Wand Savant	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.ItemCreation	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=24	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Craft Wand	DESC:You can create wands of spells up to 9th level and increase the charge capacity beyond 50.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.70
